# Exact requests from the successful local demonstration.
# Replays create new resources: use npm run demo to capture fresh IDs for a complete workflow.

### A creates a discoverable project (observed HTTP 201)
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/projects
X-Dev-User-Id: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Group 9 persistent local demo",
  "visibility": "DISCOVERABLE",
  "description": "Fictional demonstration data stored only on this computer."
}

### B requests to join (observed HTTP 201)
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/projects/60416386-a478-4997-a8aa-50eaa7d3083d/join-requests
X-Dev-User-Id: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
Content-Type: application/json

{
